      "content": "exactly. it's just endless. sometimes i lay in bed and just think... if there was a way to just stop the loop, you know? like, if i could actually have control over something for once instead of just letting the warehouse dictate my whole life. it feels like the only way to actually be free would be to just opt out of the system entirely.",
